Droidspaces v7.0.0 support for the pinned LineageOS 4.9 kernel.
Reference: ravindu644/Droidspaces-OSS @ 37e8b45de5ddc57d35cb8adfd8327add75e25159.
Enable macvlan networking and the optional recent match for UFW/Fail2Ban.
The core namespace/NAT/resource configuration and cgroup prefix repair are
already supplied by kernel-4.9-adaptation.patch. Preserve WALT scheduling;
its Kconfig excludes CFS_BANDWIDTH, so CPU quotas remain unavailable.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/enchilada_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/enchilada_defconfig
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/enchilada_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/enchilada_defconfig
@@ -190,6 +190,7 @@
 CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_PKTTYPE=y
 CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_QUOTA=y
 CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_QUOTA2=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_RECENT=y
 CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_SOCKET=y
 CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_STATE=y
 CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_STATISTIC=y
@@ -253,6 +254,7 @@
 CONFIG_L2TP_ETH=y
 CONFIG_BRIDGE=y
 CONFIG_VETH=y
+CONFIG_MACVLAN=y
 CONFIG_NET_SCHED=y
 CONFIG_NET_SCH_FQ=y
 CONFIG_NET_SCH_FQ_CODEL=y
